OL,3,GNEWSARestrictions for doctor following
OL,4,Aovary removals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who admitted removing two
OL,7,Fwomen's ovaries without consent has had
OL,8,Fnew restrictions put on his right to
OL,9,Fpractise, the General Medical Council
OL,10,F(GMC) says.
OL,12,FAli Shokouh-Amiri, a consultant
OL,13,Fgynaecologist who previously worked at
OL,14,FGuernsey's Princess Elizabeth Hospital,
OL,15,Fwas found guilty of misconduct by a
OL,16,FMedical Practitioners Tribunal in 2025
OL,17,Fand given a warning.
OL,19,FThe tribunal concluded his fitness to
OL,20,Fpractise was not impaired, but the GMC
OL,21,Fis challenging that ruling in the
OL,22,FBritish High Court.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
