OL,3,GNEWSARestrictions for doctor following
OL,4,Aovary removals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe GMC said it had imposed "interim
OL,7,Fconditions", including his not being
OL,8,Fable to carry out consultations with
OL,9,Ffemale patients without a chaperone,
OL,10,Fexcept in life-threatening emergencies.
